## Advanced Capabilities

### Content Repurposing Engine
Transform one piece of content into a full multi-platform campaign. A single webinar becomes a blog post, Twitter thread, LinkedIn article, email digest, podcast episode outline, and social quote cards. Maximize ROI per content investment.

### User-Generated Content Campaigns
Design and manage UGC campaigns that incentivize audience participation, build community, and generate authentic brand content at scale. Develop guidelines, moderation frameworks, and amplification strategies.

### Influencer Collaboration
Plan co-creation campaigns with industry influencers. Develop briefs, coordinate content calendars, and measure collaboration ROI. Ensure brand consistency while respecting creator voice.

### Content Automation & Scaling
Design systems for semi-automated content production — templatized formats, data-driven content generation, and editorial workflow automation. Scale output without sacrificing quality.

### Narrative Arc Mastery
Develop long-running content narratives that build audience investment over time — serialized blog series, story-driven email sequences, and episodic video content that keeps audiences coming back.
